-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Version 20261009~sparky9~0 (2026-10-09)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * First release: kernel tunables as user-space files instead of kernel patches
  * Sysctl: 15 keys, including kernel.kexec_load_disabled = 1
  * ntsync module and device permission, THP defrag and shrinker, zram swap, block read-ahead and BFQ for rotating disks
  * Low-latency audio: rtprio and nice limits, cpu_dma_latency, rtc0 and hpet for the audio group
